## Context

Memo `conception/2026-10-31-monitoring-redesign.md` § 4.2. Transcripts are deleted by age (`cleanupPeriodDays: 180`;
the oldest surviving one, of 2026-06-10, passes the horizon around
2026-12-07), stay on the host that ran them, and five routes keep none
(vibe: disposable `VIBE_HOME` in `gaze_seat.py`; aider: history to `/dev/null`,
`skills/route/routes.json:140`; Pi seats: `--no-session`, `routes.json:104`;
the Pi subagent extension: `--no-session`, `routes.json:100`;
`manuscript_review.py`: `--no-session-persistence`).
Measured: median transcript 0.4 MB, p99 5.9 MB; October volume about 5.8 GB raw,
10–16x under zstd. Part of tracker 1382.

Design constraints: plain zstd, one file per source file, original relative
path kept, contents unmodified, under
`~/archive/transcripts/<host>/<runtime>/`; Claude Code's `subagents/` and
`tool-results/` included; a source whose size changed since its last copy is
copied again (transcripts only append); nightly systemd user timer; doudou
pushes to padme when online. Same disk and permissions as the live tree, no
encryption (memo § 5: required only if the archive leaves the host). Nothing
committed to git.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] An archive script with a test: a fixture tree of the three runtimes'
      layouts is archived; a grown source is re-copied; an unchanged one is not;
      a file touched within the last day is skipped
- [ ] The timer unit is installed on padme and has run once; every transcript
      untouched for a day is in the archive at its current size (count and
      bytes compared, both printed)
- [ ] vibe, aider, Pi seats and Pi subagents keep their session files under the
      archive spool (aider's history outside the review tree);
      `manuscript_review.py` no longer passes `--no-session-persistence`; each
      flag change checked against the CLI's `--help`
- [ ] One seat per route (claude, codex, pi, aider, vibe, where reachable) and
      one manuscript-review reader leave a session file that the archive holds;
      an unreachable route is named in the PR, not counted as covered
- [ ] The headless-cleanup experiment: a `claude -p --restricted` seat under a
      scratch `CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR` holding a 40-day-old transcript; the result
      (deleted or kept) recorded in the memo § 2.3 and, if deleted, a fix
      shipped in this ticket
- [ ] doudou: the push path documented and run once when reachable, or the
      ticket says it was unreachable and leaves a `needs-human` follow-up note

## Raid 8ad75a plan annotation (2026-10-31, lead)

Phases 2-3 compressed (see 1380). Feasibility: WARN (resolved below). Plan text: /tmp/raid-8ad75a/plan-1383.md (host padme). Wave 1, parallel with 1380.

Path: `scripts/transcript_spool.py` (ARCHIVE_ROOT honouring `IDH_ARCHIVE_ROOT`, `host()`, `archive_dir`, `spool_dir`, `seat_id`, LIVE_ROOTS), `scripts/transcript_archive.py` (zstd CLI, tmp+replace, dest mtime stamped to source), units in `scripts/systemd/` (use `%h`), flag changes at the five doors, INSTALL.md runbook.
Lead rulings:
- 1383 owns every session-persistence flag (routes.json pi `--session-dir <spool>`, aider history files, vibe output, pi-subagent-link patched copy, manuscript_review drop of `--no-session-persistence`). 1384 forks after this merges and imports `transcript_spool`.
- Change detection by source mtime stamped on the archived copy (appends change mtime); meets "grown source re-copied".
- vibe via `--output-dir <spool>` (memo said persistent VIBE_HOME; note deviation in PR). SIGKILL on timeout loses vibe's copy: either spool VIBE_HOME instead or state the loss in the PR.
- Live roots honour `CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR`, `CODEX_HOME`, `PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR` when set.
- Tests must never write the real `~/archive`: add an autouse conftest fixture setting `IDH_ARCHIVE_ROOT` to tmp.
- Update gaze tests that pin argv: `test_gaze_seat.py:717` (vibe argv[2]), `:507` (pi build_command without values).
- doudou unreachable at 09:59 today (ssh: no route to host); unless reachable at execution, ship the runbook and leave the needs-human follow-up note. Installing anything on doudou is the author's call.
- Headless-cleanup experiment only under scratch `CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR`, positive control first; never touch real `~/.claude`.

